OL,4,CPROGRAMMES
OL,5,
OL,6,CG1983FThe weekday morning airing of
OL,7,FPlay School moved to BBC One from
OL,8,Ftoday. The morning screening had
OL,9,Fpreviously gone out on BBC Two, for
OL,10,Falmost 20 years.
OL,11,
OL,12,CG1983FBBC TV programmes for schools
OL,13,Fand colleges move to BBC Two, under the
OL,14,Ftitle Daytime on 2.
