OL,3,CTV-related anniversaries for 19 SEP
OL,4,CPROGRAMMES
OL,5,
OL,6,CG2022FThe funeral of HM Queen
OL,7,FElizabeth II at Westminster Abbey is
OL,8,Ftelevised. More than 50 UK channels
OL,9,Fcarried the live coverage, including
OL,10,FBBC One, BBC Two (with signing), ITV
OL,11,Fand Sky News.
OL,12,
OL,13,FThe overall audience peaked at 12.25pm
OL,14,F- at 28 million - as the coffin was
OL,15,Fcarried through the streets from
OL,16,FWestminster Abbey. Around 20 million
OL,17,Fpeople watched on BBC One at that time,
OL,18,Fwhile ITV's audience numbers peaked at
OL,19,F5.3 million.
OL,20,
OL,21,FCBBC and CBeebies ran their planned
OL,22,Fschedule. Channel 4 showed The Queen's
OL,23,Sppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBOn This DayCClean FeedFNat TV
